message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: WENDy-Constrained
abstract: "Weak-form parameter estimation (WENDy) extended with a structure matrix and an offset vector, so that the coefficients of an ODE system can be tied together, fixed to known values, or both. Demonstrated on the fully-mixed two-layer online-offline engagement model."
